---
import AgencyHero from '../components/AgencyHero.astro';

import Portfolio from '../layouts/Portfolio.astro';
import ProjectShowcase from '../components/ProjectShowcase.astro';
import PortfolioContact from '../components/PortfolioContact.astro';
import { projects } from '../lib/portfolio';
import { url } from '../lib/content';
const selectedProjects = ['sift-and-saffron', 'noura-beauty-house', 'crumb-and-cup', 'loom-and-kiln', 'brightpath-academy', 'second-story', 'les-mots-dun-montagnard', 'her-circle'].map(slug => projects.find(project => project.slug === slug)!);
const services = [
 ['One-page website · 350 AED', 'Up to six sections, mobile layout, contact links and basic search setup.'],
 ['Business website · 500 AED', 'Up to five simple pages with services, gallery and contact information. Mobile layout and basic search setup included.'],
 ['Logo design · 300 AED', 'Two initial directions, one final logo, two revision rounds, and SVG and PNG files.'],
 ['Starter visual identity · 600 AED', 'The logo package, colours, font pairing, a short usage guide and an Instagram profile image.'],
];
const process = [
 ['Brief', 'We establish what your business offers, what visitors should do and whether the project fits the scope.'],
 ['Written quote', 'Pages, features, revisions, costs, payment terms, cancellation terms and ownership are agreed in writing.'],
 ['Initial payment', 'The proposed payment split is 50% to begin and 50% before handover, with cancellation terms stated in the quote.'],
 ['Collect content', 'You supply the text, photos and existing branding. The delivery schedule starts once the required materials arrive.'],
 ['Design & build', 'We approve a visual direction before I complete the pages and build the mobile layout.'],
 ['Review', 'For websites, you send one consolidated list of changes. Logo work includes two revision rounds.'],
 ['Test', 'I check mobile layouts, links, agreed forms and the key journeys visitors will take.'],
 ['Handover', 'After final payment, you receive the agreed files, account access and instructions for requesting updates.'],
];
---
<Portfolio>
  <AgencyHero/>
  <section id="work" class="work-section wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / SELECTED WORK</p><h2>Different projects.<br/>The same attention to detail<span class="dot">.</span></h2></div><p>Websites for businesses, communities and independent voices. Explore the visual identity and desktop and phone previews for each project.</p></div><ProjectShowcase projects={selectedProjects}/></section>
  <section id="services" class="services-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / WHAT I CAN HELP WITH</p><h2>Your first website.<br/>A clear visual identity<span class="dot">.</span></h2></div><p>For home bakeries, cafés, women-owned businesses, salons, tutors, workshop organisers, communities and independent professionals. Built for enquiries when your business has outgrown Instagram or WhatsApp.</p></div><div class="launch-bundle"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE MAIN OFFER / BUSINESS LAUNCH BUNDLE</p><h3>A home for your business.<br/>A look that feels like you.</h3><p>Up to five simple website pages plus a starter visual identity: logo, colours, font pairing, usage guide and Instagram profile image.</p></div><div><p class="bundle-price">1,000 <span>AED</span></p><a class="button" href="#contact">Discuss your launch ↗</a><p>Already have your branding? The 500 AED business website is available separately.</p></div></div><p class="package-note">Introductory website prices apply to the first three paid website projects, including bundles. Prices will be reviewed after those projects.</p><div class="services-list">{services.map(([name,description],i)=><div class="service"><span class="service-number">0{i+1}</span><h3>{name}</h3><p>{description}</p><span class="service-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div>)}</div><div class="scope-grid"><div><h3>Included with every website</h3><p>One consolidated revision round, client-supplied text and photos, mobile layout, basic search setup and deployment setup. These are static websites without a CMS; content changes are requested from me.</p></div><div><h3>Quoted separately</h3><p>Extra pages, a second language, copywriting, substantial rewriting, connected appointment or enquiry forms, and provider costs. Menus, packaging, business cards and social templates are individually priced additions.</p></div><div><h3>Clear feature boundaries</h3><p>A request form collects an enquiry; it does not confirm an appointment. Live availability and payments need a separate project scope. Ecommerce work is currently shown as portfolio concepts only.</p></div><div><h3>After launch</h3><p>You own your domain and hosting accounts; I handle setup. Domain and paid services are charged separately at the actual agreed cost. Suitable static sites may use a free hosting tier after its terms and limits are checked.</p><p>You have 14 days to report faults in the agreed work. Content changes are quoted before work begins, with a trial minimum of 50 AED for a small update. Monthly care is offered only for a defined recurring need.</p></div></div><p class="package-note">Revisions follow the agreed scope. Ongoing support and search rankings are not guaranteed.</p><a class="text-link" href="#contact">Let’s find the right fit for your project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
  <section class="identity-study wrap" aria-labelledby="identity-title"><p class="eyebrow">VISUAL IDENTITY / SELF-INITIATED CONCEPT</p><h2 id="identity-title">Sift &amp; Saffron.<br/>A small brand, thoughtfully made<span class="dot">.</span></h2><p>A starter identity exploration for the fictional home bakery featured above. The need: a recognisable name across a website and Instagram. The solution: a warm wordmark, a compact profile mark and a simple palette. These are new portfolio concept assets, with no client endorsement or sales results claimed.</p><div class="identity-board">{[['sift-primary.svg','Primary wordmark'],['sift-reverse.svg','Reversed logo for dark backgrounds'],['sift-profile.svg','Compact Instagram profile mark'],['sift-card.svg','Thank-you card application']].map(([file,label]) => <figure><img src={url('images/portfolio/identity/'+file)} alt={label+' for Sift and Saffron'} width="1000" height="650" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>{label} · <a class="text-link" href={url('images/portfolio/identity/'+file)} download>Download SVG ↓</a></figcaption></figure>)}</div><div class="identity-details"><div><h3>Colour &amp; typography</h3><p>Cocoa #432F28, cream #F7F2EA and terracotta #9E4B36 match the bakery website. The website pairs Libre Caslon Display with DM Sans; these downloadable wordmark studies use Georgia and Arial fallbacks. Use cocoa text on cream for everyday reading.</p></div><div><h3>Short usage guide</h3><p>Use the primary wordmark on light backgrounds and the reversed version on cocoa. Leave clear space around the logo of at least the height of its capital S. Keep the wordmark proportions intact; use the compact mark when the full name becomes too small to read. The card shows an optional design addition, quoted separately from the identity package.</p></div></div></section>
  <section id="about" class="about-section wrap"><div class="about-intro"><p class="eyebrow">03 / THE PERSON BEHIND THE BUILD</p><h2>A design eye.<br/>A technical mindset<span class="dot">.</span></h2><div class="about-mark" aria-hidden="true">&lt; / &gt;<span>DESIGN MEETS DEVELOPMENT</span></div></div><div class="about-copy"><p class="large-copy">Hi, I’m ken.lou, the designer and developer behind Under the Haik. I’m based in Dubai, with a background in cybersecurity, systems administration and networking.</p><p>That background helps me think beyond the page: how a website is hosted, how it is maintained and how the parts connect. I bring that care to websites that are straightforward to use and practical to manage.</p><h3>What that means for your project</h3><div class="strengths"><div><h4>Built on solid foundations</h4><p>Infrastructure knowledge and security awareness inform hosting choices, updates and how forms and integrations are handled.</p></div><div><h4>Ready for real screens</h4><p>Layouts, navigation and images are considered across phones, tablets and desktop screens.</p></div><div><h4>Clear from the start</h4><p>We agree on scope and priorities, with clear communication through design, review and handover.</p></div><div><h4>Help beyond the design</h4><p>I can handle domains, hosting and deployment, with accounts owned by you and clear instructions for future changes.</p></div></div></div></section>
  <section id="process" class="process-section wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">04 / HOW WE GET THERE</p><h2>A clear process.<br/>From first chat to launch<span class="dot">.</span></h2></div><p>You’ll know what we’re working on, what comes next and where your feedback fits.</p></div><ol class="process-grid">{process.map(([name,description],i)=><li><span class="step-number">0{i+1}<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span><h3>{name}</h3><p>{description}</p></li>)}</ol></section>
  <section class="agency-faq wrap"><p class="eyebrow">BEFORE WE BEGIN</p><h2>Your website questions, answered.</h2><details><summary>Will my website work on phones?</summary><p>Yes. Every website includes a responsive layout, with the main pages and visitor journeys checked on desktop and phone screens.</p></details><details><summary>How much does a website cost?</summary><p>Introductory prices start at 350 AED for a one-page website and 500 AED for a simple business website. The 1,000 AED launch bundle combines a website and starter visual identity. Domain and provider costs are quoted separately.</p></details><details><summary>How do we get started?</summary><p>Ready to begin? Send me your business details, the pages you need, your budget and your preferred launch date. We agree on a written scope and quote before work starts.</p></details><details><summary>Can you create my logo and colours too?</summary><p>Yes. Logo design is available from 300 AED, and a starter visual identity from 600 AED. The business launch bundle includes a logo, colour palette, font pairing, short usage guide and Instagram profile image.</p></details><details><summary>What happens after launch?</summary><p>You receive the agreed files and account access. You have 14 days to report faults in the agreed work. Content updates are quoted before work begins.</p></details></section>
  <PortfolioContact/>
</Portfolio>

